  <item>
    <title>爆米花电台 vol.19 | 聊聊我在虹巢的这七个月（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ba59f7ad149b89b422f1c2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ba59f7ad149b89b422f1c2</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Aug 2023 05:19:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<span>这是一期随意的聊天，我和haiyan一起聊聊她在虹巢这七个月筹备博士论文的回顾和记录。在里面，可能有大段的思考与空白，能听到窗外的夏日蝉鸣，服务员端来咖啡的声音，还有偶尔的脚步声，这些环境音我和她都觉得很好，很自然，很生活，不需要太专业，这只是随性的一次闲聊。</span><br><br><span>在开始聊天前，我和haiyan都不知道这一期会不会上线，能不能上线。于是我们决定先录、先聊，聊完之后再一起判断适不适合上线的问题，这样比较不会有心理负担。</span><br><br><span>于是，它就这样发生了。。。</span><br><br><span>策划/主播：李逍遥</span><br><span>后期制作：李逍遥</span><br><span>嘉宾：haiyan</span><br><br><br><span>你将听到：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Haiyan的曲折博士路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 与 “虹巢” 的相遇</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Hey，虹巢的朋友们</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2388">39:48</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 面对不同观点时候的沟通</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2978">49:38</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 感谢虹巢，我成为一个 “泼妇” 了！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 偶尔孤独和害怕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 拥有表达的勇气</span>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://cdn.lizhi.fm/audio/2023/08/17/3025847992305964038_hd.mp3" length="64641563" type="audio/mpeg"/>
